     1,
     "<a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shiny-incubator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shiny-incubator&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391464955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw231T7sNRSkDeZuf0Dum6Nt\">https://github.com/rstudio/shiny-incubator</a> has a commandInput control that may be what you&#39;re looking for. <br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Sat, Nov 12, 2016 at 6:30 AM &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">glennm...@me.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">All,<div><br></div><div>I have an input$foo.  I would like a reactive event to occur when the user enters a value and hits either tab or return.  I see plenty of examples using boxes but I have yet to find and example on return or tab with textInput.  is this possible?</div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/8057264e-bca9-4376-83ed-fef247e938d8%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/8057264e-bca9-4376-83ed-fef247e938d8%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391464955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw21LyYOfDl2_4SVeuEFhAgx\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/8057264e-bca9-4376-83ed-fef247e938d8%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391464955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Nf15mXAmorlJPj3S9GsAs\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
