  {
   "id": "fUaqXOhkBAAJ",
   "from": "Dean Attali",
   "author": "a1bf76ab9a5a2d4b",
   "date": "2016-11-13T03:26:15Z",
   "subject": "Re: observe event",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Another alternative can be to use shinyjs::onevent() to detect when enter/tab is pressed</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shinyjs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  useShinyjs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  textInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;text&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Enter text and hit Enter or Tab&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  onevent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;keydown&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;text&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">event</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">event</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$keyCode </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">13</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      cat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Enter &quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      cat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;\\n&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">event</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$keyCode </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      cat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Tab &quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      cat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;\\n&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>But I would recommend Joe&#39;s commandInput because it&#39;s more consistent with shiny&#39;s design by using a real input where reactivity is built into the input </div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><br></div>On Saturday, 12 November 2016 15:45:21 UTC-5, Joe Cheng [RStudio]  wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shiny-incubator\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shiny-incubator&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391464957000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39iXNvcoZRcMWTlruHX_KD\">https://github.com/rstudio/shiny-incubator</a> has a commandInput control that may be what you&#39;re looking for. <br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Sat, Nov 12, 2016 at 6:30 AM &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">glennm...@me.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">All,<div><br></div><div>I have an input$foo.  I would like a reactive event to occur when the user enters a value and hits either tab or return.  I see plenty of examples using boxes but I have yet to find and example on return or tab with textInput.  is this possible?</div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/8057264e-bca9-4376-83ed-fef247e938d8%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/8057264e-bca9-4376-83ed-fef247e938d8%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391464957000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZjXsXb